CM NHE2484 objective 2: nine-rod reflector, centre-fed driven dipole
CM All rods have 8 mm diameter and 0.15 m spacing along the reflector.
CM Set corner=0 for the optimized planar reflector (default).
CM Set corner=1 for the optimized 120-degree corner reflector.
CM In corner mode, each wing makes 60 degrees with the forward +X axis.
CM Free space, 300 MHz; all dimensions in metres.
CE
SY corner=0
SY d=0.150649+0.010807*corner
SY Lr=0.458942-0.012007*corner
SY dx=0.075*corner
SY dy=0.15-0.020096*corner
SY x0=-d
SY x1=-d-dx
SY x2=-d-2*dx
SY x3=-d-3*dx
SY x4=-d-4*dx
SY y1=dy
SY y2=2*dy
SY y3=3*dy
SY y4=4*dy
GW 1 31 0 0 -0.2313 0 0 0.2313 0.004
GW 2 31 x4 -y4 -Lr/2 x4 -y4 Lr/2 0.004
GW 3 31 x3 -y3 -Lr/2 x3 -y3 Lr/2 0.004
GW 4 31 x2 -y2 -Lr/2 x2 -y2 Lr/2 0.004
GW 5 31 x1 -y1 -Lr/2 x1 -y1 Lr/2 0.004
GW 6 31 x0 0 -Lr/2 x0 0 Lr/2 0.004
GW 7 31 x1 y1 -Lr/2 x1 y1 Lr/2 0.004
GW 8 31 x2 y2 -Lr/2 x2 y2 Lr/2 0.004
GW 9 31 x3 y3 -Lr/2 x3 y3 Lr/2 0.004
GW 10 31 x4 y4 -Lr/2 x4 y4 Lr/2 0.004
GE 0
EK 0
EX 0 1 16 0 1 0
FR 0 1 0 0 300 0
RP 0 361 1 1000 -180 0 1 0
EN
